// expect: 42
// hash(x)'s user face, typed and agreeing with eq. Before this build the
// name `hash` had NO declaration anywhere — E_MissingVariable at every user
// call; the entire lower hash surface was unreachable. The declaration
// mirrors to_string's exactly (the Hash effect types the call; lower
// intercepts the name into the structural LHash node; emit dispatches from
// the live type). Equal tuples hash equal, unequal hash unequal — the
// eq/hash agreement the fold enforces. RED (E_MissingVariable) on the
// pre-build boot.
fn main() = {
  let h1 = hash((1, 2))
  let h2 = hash((1, 2))
  let h3 = hash((1, 3))
  if h1 == h2 && h1 != h3 { 42 } else { 1 }
}
